## Notes for the downstream team

- **Critical invariants**: list the ADRs whose outcomes are *inviolable*
  constraints for any port. E.g. "ADR-005 mandates idempotency keys on
  all write endpoints — any port without this is wrong".
- **Open questions**: list ADRs that the original team marked `proposed`
  or where the rationale is thin. These are *your* decisions to make
  when porting.
- **Superseded history**: if `git log` shows an ADR was reverted or
  superseded, capture that here — don't inherit the bad decision.

## Cross-references

- `wiki/decisions.md` — versão original (Phase 3) deste mesmo conjunto de ADRs
- `wiki/architecture.md` — o que foi construído
- `wiki/modules.md` — onde cada decisão se manifesta no código
- `extract/components.md` — quais componentes cada ADR restringe
- `risk-raw.md` — riscos vinculados a outcomes específicos de ADRs (ex: "ADR-007
  escolheu SQLite por simplicidade — risco sob contenção de escrita pesada")
- `implementation-guide.md` — guia clean-room referenciando estes ADRs
- `<downstream skill:port-plan path>` — plano de port específico do stack destino (opt-in)
